00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:10.214
And so, I was honing my academic skills,
I was improving them,

00:08:10.214 --> 00:08:14.128
they taught me machine learning,
they taught me AB testing.

00:08:14.128 --> 00:08:18.073
The science was more advanced inside
