00:08:18.073 --> 00:08:21.888
there was nothing like that
happening in academics at the time.

00:08:21.888 --> 00:08:26.176
Now, some people though have decided
to stay in the tech firm careers.

00:08:26.176 --> 00:08:29.103
And I think that one reason
why academics are happy there,

00:08:29.103 --> 00:08:32.524
is that their jobs are actually
